    <data key="d0">T-Mobile Standardized Immutable Kubernetes Infrastructure</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1ZLiRT0C2Yo</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing T-Mobile's multi-region, multi-account Kubernetes infrastructure deployment pattern using Transit Gateway to connect on-premises data centers to AWS services.</data>
